Start
Read the string s.
Remove the leading spaces.
Check the sign:
If -, set sign as negative.
If +, set sign as positive.
Initialize num = 0.
Read the digits one by one.
Form the number using each digit.
Multiply the number by its sign.
If the number is less than -2147483648, return -2147483648.
If the number is greater than 2147483647, return 2147483647.
Otherwise, return the number.
Stop.